<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasExistingControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a Risk with a description of what administrative/procedural/existing controls measures are currently in place to mitigate the risk. Include engineering controls, policies, procedures, protocols, guidelines (clinical and non-clinical), training, emergency arrangements, preventative maintenance controls etc. When examining existing control measures, consider the adequacy, method of implementation and level of effectiveness in eliminating or minimising risk to the lowest practicable level."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasExistingControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has existing control"@en .
