<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskRating> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2020-09-22T09:53:21+00:00" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskRating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a Risk to its Risk Rating. Based on the HSE Risk Matrix – multiplying the inherent Impact by the likelihood will give the risk rating (1-25)." .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskRating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has risk rating" .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskStatus
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRiskStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
