<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#probability> "0.01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#score> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Rob Brennan"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2020-09-29T09:09:10+00:00"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Probability: 1%. Actual Frequency: Occurs every 5 years or more. A type of Risk Likelihood."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#rareRemote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Rare/Remote"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#ImpactCategory> .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Rob Brennan" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2021-01-29T09:52:00+00:00" .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Risks  which  threaten  the  delivery  of  a  service  provision  to  service  users  in terms  of  quality,  in  a  comfortable,  caring  and  safe  environment,  delivered  in  a  calm  and  reassuring  way;  having  information  to  make  choices,  to  feel  confident  and  to  feel  in  control;  being  listened  to  and  talked  to  as  an  equal;  being treated with honesty, respect and dignity. A type of Risk Impact Category described in the Impact Table."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#serviceUserExperience> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Service User Experience"@en .
